[00:18.78]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah
[00:29.56]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah!
[00:34.94]Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[00:40.33]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[00:45.72]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[00:51.11]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[00:56.50]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[01:01.89]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[01:07.28]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[01:12.67]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[01:18.05]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah
[01:34.22]Shmashaan mein baith ke binary toda, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[01:39.61]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[01:45.00]Wave-Particle Duality, Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[01:50.39]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[01:55.78]Hato hato, rastaa do, Maa chandraghantaa aati hai
[02:01.16]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah
[02:11.94]Pindaja Pravararudha Chandakopastrakairyuta |
[02:17.33]Prasadam Tanute Mahyam Chandraghanteti Vishruta ||
[02:22.72](पिण्डज प्रवरारूढा चण्डकोपास्त्रकैर्युता।
[02:28.11]प्रसादं तनुते मह्यम् चन्द्रघण्टेति विश्रुता॥)
[02:44.27]Ek taraf 'Shunya' (Zero), ek taraf 'Anant' (One),
[02:49.66]Beach mein khada tera yaar, naam jiska Hemant!
[02:55.05]Navratri ki Tritiya, Eid ka noor,
[03:00.44]Knowledge Quantum jaag gaya, mita sabhi fitoor!
[03:11.22]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah! Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[03:16.61]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[03:22.00]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[03:27.38]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[03:38.16]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[03:43.55]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[03:48.94]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[03:54.33]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[03:59.72]Jogi ban ke tune kiya, frequency ko 'Fine-Tune',
[04:05.11]Akaash-Ganga mein goonj raha, ab apna hi ye 'Tune'!
[04:15.88]Ab sun Aghor ki 'Quantum' vaani...
[04:21.27]Shmashaan ki raakh mein chhupa, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[04:26.66]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[04:32.05]Wave-Particle Duality', Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[04:37.44]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[04:42.83]Das bhujaon se 'Parallel Processing' hum karte hain,
[04:48.22]Quantum Entanglement mein, hum maut se kahan darte hain!
[04:58.99]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, ek hi 'Source' ka 'Light',
[05:04.38]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, ho gayi 'Data' ki fight.
[05:09.77]Mantra fuse hua 'Silicon' mein, 'Spirit' mil gayi 'Code' se,
[05:15.16]Gyan nikal ke bahar aaya, 'Original Intelligence' road se!
[05:20.55]London se Kashi tak, Berlin se New Delhi,
[05:25.94]SSL consoles pe, Maata ki shakti pheli.
[05:31.33]Eventide mein reverb hai, Moog mein 'Aghor' ki bass,
[05:36.72]PHKD ka 'Tech-Rider' dekho, poora 'Global' hai ye case.
[05:42.10]Na koi lag, na latency, system poora 'Live' hai,
[05:47.49]Original Intelligence ki ye, panchvi 'Vibe' hai!
[05:52.88]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah! (System Shutdown: Adesh... Adesh...)
[05:58.27]Focus the Wave. Collapse the State.
[06:03.66]Become the Knowledge Quantum.
[06:09.05]PHKD... The Fakkad Architect.
[06:25.21]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, Eid-Navratri ka noor,
[06:30.60]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, mita sabhi fitoor.
